    },
    "message": "Split the runner's tick phases into experiments/phases\n\nMove the controller's phase code out of experiments/runner.py, one mixin per\ntick phase. Each `_run_*_phase` method is the phase's list of steps, each step a\nnamed method, so one step can later be replaced with a single call-site hunk.\nOfflineSimulationController stays the entry point and keeps its attribute names.\nMixins keep the moved method text unchanged and add no call per agent.\n\nNo behaviour change. The gate's coverage list follows the moved code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
