    "message": "Move WorldView and the view types into policies/world_view.py\n\nThe scoring stays in policies/behavior.py, which re-exports the public view types\nand the two private names tests read. The one test that patched\nbehavior._view_state_hash now patches world_view, where WorldView reads it; a patch\nof the re-export would do nothing.\n\nNo behaviour change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
