    "message": "Split the contact kernels into rules/social_propagation and rules/information\n\nThe two kernels move to native/src/rules/, where build.rs finds them, and stay\nregistered at the top of the module, so Python's calls do not change. The sampling\nand record reading they share stay in contacts.rs, now pub(crate).\n\nNo behaviour change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
